      "end": 8,
      "text": " A customer success manager makes sure every lawyer call ends with a next step the member acts on."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 8,
      "end": 16,
      "text": " Lawyer calls work when the member arrives prepared and someone follows through afterwards, and at ILP that someone is you."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 16,
      "end": 22,
      "text": " Each morning the portal puts the members who need you most at the top, with a playbook for each situation."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 22,
      "end": 27,
      "text": " You own the relationship with each member, and the lawyer keeps the legal advice."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 27,
      "end": 34,
      "text": " There is no online application yet. Write to the ILP team about your client experience and the languages you speak."
    }
  ],
